    "updated_at": "2021-05-20T11:48:36Z",
    "body": "In Chromium, if I understand @josepharhar correctly, sequential focus navigation (pressing tab) will call `element.focus()` which in turn calls \"scroll into view\". If Gecko has the same approach, it makes sense for the spec to align. If Gecko has a different approach, it seems good to understand it first. :)",
