    "created_at": "2021-05-20T11:54:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-20T11:54:29Z",
    "body": "If I understand the Gecko code correctly, it first moves focus, then checks if focus changed, and if so calls \"scroll into view\". With some exceptions where scrolling doesn't happen.",
